67
00:07:42.253 --> 00:07:44.078
Option A: Gorm.

68
00:07:44.078 --> 00:07:45.965
Option B: Harald.

69
00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:47.982
Option C: Christian.
[DA] Hvad hedder Kronprins Frederik og Kronprinsesse Marys ældste søn?  A: Gorm  |  B: Harald  |  C: Christian

70
00:07:54.532 --> 00:07:56.757
The answer is C: Christian.

71
00:07:56.707 --> 00:08:00.984
It appeared in the June 2020 and November 2022 exams.
[DA] ✔ C: Christian

72
