78
00:08:23.657 --> 00:08:27.924
It appeared in the June 2022 and May 2024 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: 1972

79
00:08:28.474 --> 00:08:29.811
Question 3.

80
00:08:29.761 --> 00:08:33.399
