Option A: Frederik the Fourth.

82
00:08:36.011 --> 00:08:38.686
Option B: Frederik the Seventh.

83
00:08:38.686 --> 00:08:41.238
Option C: Frederik the Tenth.
[DA] Hvem blev Danmarks nye konge i januar 2024?  A: Frederik den 4.  |  B: Frederik den 7.  |  C: Frederik den 10.

84
00:08:47.788 --> 00:08:50.350
The answer is C: Frederik the Tenth.

85
00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.896
It appeared in the May 2024 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Frederik den 10.

86
00:08:53.446 --> 00:08:54.746
Question 4.

87
00:08:54.696 --> 00:08:57.883
Which country does Queen Mary originally come from?

88
00:08:57.883 --> 00:08:59.546
Option A: Canada.

89
00:08:59.546 --> 00:09:01.833
Option B: Great Britain.

90
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:03.786
Option C: Australia.
[DA] Hvilket land kommer dronning Mary oprindeligt fra?  A: Canada  |  B: Storbritannien  |  C: Australien

91
00:09:10.336 --> 00:09:12.486
The answer is C: Australia.

92
00:09:12.436 --> 00:09:15.108
It appeared in the May 2025 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Australien

93
00:09:15.558 --> 00:09:17.430
Question 5.

94
00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:22.350
